# WHAT IS DELIBERATELY NOT HERE, AND WHY
#
# This repository holds the PRODUCT (four templates, the evaluation harness, the docs and
# findings) — not the EVIDENCE. Stored results are 129G and cannot live on a remote; they are
# backed up separately, see tasks/12.
#
# Nothing here is "temporary files". Each entry is either build output that regenerates, or
# evidence too large to push. If you add an entry, say which.

# ---- stored evidence: 129G. Backed up separately, never pushed. -------------------------
eval/runs/
staging/

# ---- build output, regenerates from source --------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/artifacts/
**/coverage/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Unity: Library/ is a multi-GB import cache, Temp/ and obj/ are per-build.
# Assets/Analyzers/*.dll is NOT ignored — the analyzer binaries are part of the template.
**/Library/
**/Temp/
**/obj/
**/Logs/
**/MemoryCaptures/
**/UserSettings/
*.csproj
*.sln

# Godot import cache
**/.godot/
**/*.import

# Python envs
.venv/
venv/

# ---- machine-local, not shared ---------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
